      "id": "mathematics-01-028",
      "number": 28,
      "question": "If the diagonal of a rectangle is 17 cm and its perimeter is 46 cm, find its area.",
      "options": {
        "A": "100 cm²",
        "B": "110 cm²",
        "C": "120 cm²",
        "D": "130 cm²"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "l+b = 23, l^2+b^2 = 289. (l+b)^2 = l^2+b^2+2lb => 529 = 289 + 2lb => 2lb = 240 => lb = 120.",
      "hash": "9adc59a414195177",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि एक आयत का विकर्ण 17 सेमी है और इसका परिमाप 46 सेमी है, तो इसका क्षेत्रफल ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "100 सेमी²",
            "B": "110 सेमी²",
            "C": "120 सेमी²",
            "D": "120 सेमी²"
          },
          "explanation": "l+b = 23, l^2+b^2 = 289. (l+b)^2 = l^2+b^2+2lb => 529 = 289 + 2lb => 2lb = 240 => lb = 120।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-01-029",
      "number": 29,
      "question": "How many terms are there in the series 201, 208, 215, ..., 369?",
      "options": {
        "A": "23",
        "B": "24",
        "C": "25",
        "D": "26"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "n = [(Last - First)/Diff] + 1 = [(369-201)/7] + 1 = 168/7 + 1 = 24 + 1 = 25.",
      "hash": "c3b8c025c4ee2387",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "श्रेणी 201, 208, 215, ..., 369 में कितने पद हैं?",
          "options": {
            "A": "23",
            "B": "24",
            "C": "25",
            "D": "26"
          },
          "explanation": "n = [(अंतिम - प्रथम)/अंतर] + 1 = [(369-201)/7] + 1 = 168/7 + 1 = 24 + 1 = 25।"
        }
      }
    },
